ction and chemistry. It made me feel like their relationship wouldn’t be fulfilling for either of them in the long run.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere was no major conflict in this story, which made this story slightly boring. The characters tried to act like there was something getting in the way of their marriage, but there really wasn’t. Everyone was on board with them marrying right away.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI think Laura Greenwood’s books will work for some people, but this one unfortunately didn’t work for me and I most likely won’t be picking up more of her books in the future.","rating":1,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ALOB2RG2P8Z9M\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.k75t-UiRTUjslITy\"}}"},"likeCount":37,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":3},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1H8C96LP8TSSV":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1H8C96LP8TSSV"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1H8C96LP8TSSV\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.k75t-UiRTUjslITy\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1H8C96LP8TSSV","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1H8C96LP8TSSV"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.k75t-UiRTUjslITy","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.k75t-UiRTUjslITy"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/19290780?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4383893341"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.QKz3W0XSdlO2mzqBfO9peg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.QKz3W0XSdlO2mzqBfO9peg","creator":{"__ref":"User:19290780"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1687612447278,"createdAt":1639262017058,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionA