 fine story to a twirl around the dance floor. The two of the are ideally suited for each other and this is the story of how they get their hea.\u003cbr /\u003eI loved Victoria’s story and the glimpses of the bond she had with Denise and how the sisters helped each other. I was so pleased to see that Denise got her own book! Filled with all the drama and glamour of the age with the twist of shifters added in this series is a group of lighthearted romances that are each a happy read!.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI received a free copy of this book and am voluntarily leaving a review.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2A77OXS4ROZ6J\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.k75t-UiRTUjslITy\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:55860717":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":55860717,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1715592709i/55860717._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":12,"textReviewsCount":2907,"name":"Goddess of Chaos","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/55860717-goddess-of-chaos","contributor":null,"id":55860717},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AL0P6XI3W1MQZ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AL0P6XI3W1MQZ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AL0P6XI3W1MQZ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.k75t-UiRTUjslITy\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AL0P6XI3W1MQZ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AL0P6XI3W1MQZ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.k75t-UiRTUjslITy","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.k75t-UiRTUjslITy"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/55860717?shelf=read"},"taggings"